Figure 1 redesigned after top-venue practice: concept and results in two bands

The five shifts become the input column of a decision tree that follows one
definition item through a redefinition (detection by a key, repair by an
executable derivation, the value served); one colour per role, reused in the
results panels; direct labels instead of a legend; no box over four lines.
Numbers are unchanged macros of generated/numbers.tex. 61 pages, main text
ends on page 9; the Overleaf fast zip compiles in one pdflatex + one BibTeX run.

